{"id":"n63082-1-12","stage":4,"title":"선두 · 前列","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63082-1-12-1","ko":"누가 반장이에요?","zh":"谁是班长啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"반장이에요?","meaning":"班长","explanation":"반장：班长；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"반장","audio":"/audio/42215d859bc4bc8e6a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57186","senseId":"3","lemma":"반장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반장이에요","audio":"/audio/95258c49ecf7fe5d3327.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"42215d859bc4bc8e","term":"반장","zh":"班长","audio":"/audio/42215d859bc4bc8e6a78.mp3","entryId":"57186","definition":"学校里代表班级的人。","pronunciation":["반장"]}],"audio":"/audio/061961dbdfdf6216e807.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63082-1-12-2","ko":"저기 아이들이 줄을 서 있는 게 보이죠? 제일 선두에 있는 학생이 반장이에요.","zh":"看到那边排队的孩子们了吗？站在最前面的那个学生就是班长。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"아이들이","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이들이","audio":"/audio/ac32747784d62b1df40f.mp3"}},{"text":"줄을","meaning":"队，行列","explanation":"줄：队，行列；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64702","senseId":"2","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄을","audio":"/audio/5e27b5ff77c8de3b5ad1.mp3"}},{"text":"서","meaning":"排，站","explanation":"서다：排，站；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"서다","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68756","senseId":"19","lemma":"서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서","audio":"/audio/a5bc3484406e4a8fc29e.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"보이죠?","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이죠","audio":"/audio/9bbc20a899dcfc2ebd70.mp3"}},{"text":"제일","meaning":"最","explanation":"제일：最","readings":[{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92032","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}},{"text":"선두에","meaning":"前列，领先，领头羊","explanation":"선두：前列，领先，领头羊；에：格助词，表